        "A. \\(y = {\\log _5}x\\).",
        "B. \\(y = {\\log _{15}}x\\).",
        "C. \\(y = {\\log _{10}}x\\).",
        "D. \\(y = {\\log _{\\frac{1}{5}}}x\\)."
